  "title": "Bakugan: Armored Alliance",
  "justification": "Each of the 52 AniDB episodes holds two segments, which TVDB season 2 and TMDB 87247 season 3 list as separate episodes, 104 in all, in the same order: episode 1 \"The Mysterious Boy / A New Power\" is episodes 1-2, episode 2 \"Baku-Gear / Bakugan Rock!\" is 3-4, and so on to episode 52 at 103-104. The aired order swaps two pairs: AniDB 18 \"Here Comes Haavik / The Fusion Bakugan Arrive\" is episodes 37-38 (2020-07-26) and AniDB 19 \"The Director / Queen Ebony\" is 35-36 (2020-07-19). By default episode k fell on episode k. TMDB season 2 is the earlier \"Battle Planet\" season (\"The Forbidden Isle\"), so tmdbseason moves to 3.",
